Flutter widget evidence for backlog item 4.

No physical device log was captured in this UI-only slice. The proof uses a
MediaListWidget harness with one currently uploading video and a deterministic
0.5 progress value. The rendered upload indicator shows both 50% and the byte
count 2 B / 4 B.

